          "id": "69b9f18cfa29965e80de300f3c2cc6c24e455bc3",
          "message": "fix(tests): adjust to setup-ocaml passing OPAMCONFIRMLEVEL (#9292)\n\n* fix(tests): pass --cli 2.1 to opam CLI\r\n\r\nThis ensures our test suite is future proof wrt opam CLI.\r\n\r\nAs an immediate benefit, this allows the test suite to run with\r\nsetup-ocaml 2.1.5: it sets `OPAMCONFIRMLEVEL=unsafe-yes`,\r\nwhich emits a warning if the cli version is 2.0.\r\n\r\nSee ocaml/setup-ocaml#728.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
