          "message": "pkg: include lockdirs with no context (#9557)\n\nPreviously dune acted as though lockdirs associated with no context did\r\nnot exist. This change allows such lockdirs to be solved and includes\r\nthem in other information about lockdirs.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
