          "id": "7645c873e1dadc4d7427ab9de549c53b441c595c",
          "message": "merlin: do not break lines in dump-config (#10589)\n\n* merlin: do not break lines in dump-config\r\n\r\n`dune ocaml merlin dump-config` is meant for testing and debugging.\r\n\r\nBreaking horizontal boxes is not useful here and it makes postprocessing\r\nmore difficult.\r\n\r\nSetting a large margin will make some boxes render as a single line.\r\n\r\nThis also helps with reproducibility, since sometimes long paths could\r\nbreak differently.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* grep -o\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
