          "id": "cc5582025d639ca02ac64c718f3236a0981e52d8",
          "message": "feature(pkg): dune describe pkg lock (#8841)\n\n* feature: dune describe pkg lock\r\n\r\nWe add a new `dune describe` command that displays the packages in a\r\nlock file. In order to do this, we refactored dune_pkg so that printing\r\nthe contents of the lock file is done from Lock_file.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
          "timestamp": "2023-10-17T21:25:01+01:00",
