          "id": "df349fc20181d204cc79de48008eec22827065c6",
          "message": "pkg: validate lockdir against local packages (#9172)\n\nThis adds a type `Dune_pkg.Package_universe.t` made up of the set of\r\nlocal packages in a project and a lockdir whose constructor validates\r\nthat the lockdir contains a valid solution for the dependencies of local\r\npackages. As we add more pkg operations we'll need a way of talking\r\nabout the set of packages that makes up a project, both local and not.\r\n\r\nAlso this adds a command `dune pkg validate-lockdir` which validates\r\nlockdirs against local packages in order to test this feature.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2023-11-17T15:20:40+11:00",
          "tree_id": "ba7dd8bc5e2ac84857a7944bdcda829688b69f44",
