          "message": "chore: add lang dune 3.12 (#9243)\n\nNothing is attached to it, but this ensures that we are future proof:\r\nAssuming we do not do that in 3.12.0, (lang dune 3.12) will be\r\nimplicitly be created when bumping to 3.13. Then `(lang dune 3.12)`\r\nwould incorrectly create a `>= 3.12.0` opam bound.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
