          "distinct": true,
          "id": "320127df7359fcf7c9477340a38d700aa5c38687",
          "message": "test: fix carriage return from being outputted during build (#9374)\n\nWhen we don't clear the status line, it gets cleared when we exit. This\r\ncauses a carriage return to be output by the inline test runner. When\r\nrunning the tests in the repo, this would show up as a random space.\r\n\r\nAfter investigating, I isolated the culprit to a recently added test not\r\nhaving a Status_line.clear at the end. Adding one fixes the original\r\nissue. I also updated the documentation in the tests to explain why we\r\nneed to have one.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
          "timestamp": "2023-12-04T17:22:54Z",
          "tree_id": "6057fd436d35b0d8518cb1f851e65d62318d7182",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/320127df7359fcf7c9477340a38d700aa5c38687"
