          "id": "75f5388e6925395e58bbe41564531390bce683e2",
          "message": "fix(pkg): Avoid `git` translating its UI. (#9390)\n\nTurns out that some Git commands translate their messages e.g. when\r\nrunning with a `fr_FR` locale. Then the regex fails and as such the code\r\nfails.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes sure to always run Git in English, though a better\r\nsolution would be to find a lower-level command that determines the same\r\ninfo without having to parse high-level commands that get translated.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
