          "id": "8fcec5eb8911e8d232b4e63b2c6426954ccec6bb",
          "message": "refactor(pkg): make remote reading a little more resilient (#9698)\n\nPreviously, the algorithm of looking up inside a remote would treat\r\neverything after [remote $name] as belonging to the remote. That's not\r\ncorrect because we can have other remotes after what we found.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes sure to first get the section that belongs to a remote and\r\nlimits the search to this section.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
