          "message": "test: Exercise the current semantics of checksum selection (#10694)\n\n* test: Exercise the current semantics of checksum selection\r\n\r\nIt might be useful to have a test that shows how the checksum selection\r\nworks, which checksum is selected and how it is recorded.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\r\n\r\n* Remove misleading comment\r\n\r\nOPAM seems to be validating all checksums, not just the first one:\r\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/opam/blob/e85673526bac320ff849f756ffbd54086bde2811/src/repository/opamRepository.ml#L133-L163\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\r\n\r\n* Add extra-sources to the test\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\r\n\r\n* Merge `multiple-checksums.t` into existing `hash-algos.t`\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
