          "message": "ci: do not bootstrap twice (#10746)\n\n* ci: do not bootstrap twice\r\n\r\n`make bootstrap` does exactly `make -B _boot/dune.exe`, which is done\r\njust before, so we bootstrap twice in the workflow.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* use make release to also build the install file\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
