          "id": "913ad7d87cd8d766d3a08b9413689b285918c62c",
          "message": "pkg: add dependency hash to lockdir (#9114)\n\nIf the dependencies of a local package change after the lockdir is\r\ncreated then the lockdir may no longer contain a valid solution for the\r\nproject. This change adds a hash of non-local dependencies to the\r\nlockdir metadata so dune can detect when the lockdir becomes out of\r\ndate.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
