          "id": "5e35e24f52fd96df8bf84ac0eff4fb404ba386a8",
          "message": "pkg: substitute custom solver vars in lockfiles (#9346)\n\nPrevisouly only \"with-test\" and \"with-doc\" were substituted. This\r\ngeneralizes partial evaluation of filters to include all solver vars. To\r\nallow users to set \"with-doc\" but to maintain the current behaviour\r\nwhere it defaults to \"false\", it's added to the solver env by default\r\nwith value \"false\".\r\n\r\nAlso added a case to the logic for simplifying slang expressions so the\r\ngenerated code is more readable as previously it would generate\r\nexpressions like `(when true ...)` and `(when false ...)` when a filter\r\nis applied to individual terms in a command.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2023-12-04T17:56:29+11:00",
          "tree_id": "43662a7a2a3ab152c14f334b3a6d346861bbb5e1",
