          "id": "9105a43b719cc66aefd7c7f84816bd1a77f236c7",
          "message": "refactor: introduce simpler env stanza db (#8447)\n\nThis allows us to define env related values outside of a single module with two concrete benefits:\r\n\r\n* No module dependency cycles since not everything has to go through Env_node\r\n* Very specific options live closer to where they are used\r\n\r\nIn addition, we take the opportunity to fix the issue of setting formatting options in the workspace file.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2023-12-04T16:52:30Z",
          "tree_id": "88b3ee26faa06005452365e8bb30fd73bd44cbb4",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/9105a43b719cc66aefd7c7f84816bd1a77f236c7"
