          "message": "fix(pkg): expand self reference variables (#9462)\n\n{version} and {name} should always be available\r\n\r\nThis fix required refactoring environment handling. I made\r\n[Resolve_opam_formula] agnostic to our representation of the environment\r\nand how we tracked evaluated variables so that we can append variables\r\nthat don't need to be tracked (name & version). The end result is also\r\ncleaner.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
