          "id": "28522e27ef7c9e2ad47be263bd203a370dd1cfb1",
          "message": "chore(pkg): Set the XDG chace dir in the env, use just one in the test (#9469)\n\nThere doesn't seem to have been any reason why there were two cache\r\ndirectories, so this simplifies the test a little. It can still be\r\noverridden to e.g. show that `--skip-update` will fail on an empty rev\r\nstore.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
