          "message": "feature(pkg): Enable checking out tags (#9471)\n\nThis implements the feature to check out tags. By default all remote\r\ntags get dumped into a common namespace, which is not what we want so we\r\nadd an additional refspec in the config to map the tags fetched under\r\nthe handle name.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
