          "id": "5667df731b4ad18acad9a41ae927362f3fa19f24",
          "message": "pkg: reuse downloaded archives within single run (#9771)\n\nArchives downloaded over http by package management code will be cached\r\nin a temporary directory that persists during a single invocation of\r\ndune. This is intended to reduce the number of times that dune downloads\r\nthe same file during package management operations. Note that it's\r\ncommon in the ocaml ecosystem for a single source archive to contain\r\nmultiple packages.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2024-01-24T13:09:20+11:00",
          "tree_id": "1bd67398d546a619e4a66d4f854496d15e278560",
