          "id": "fb4af5c78abcc263656330cdcd2d61a47268074e",
          "message": "chore: add missing unix dependencies (#9921)\n\nSee #8607 for a recent example.\r\n\r\nOCaml 5 adds a `ocaml_deprecated_auto_include` alert when the `unix`\r\nlibrary is referenced but without an explicit dependency.\r\n\r\nThis commit fixes these alerts by adding a dependency to `unix` in\r\nplaces that refer to `Unix` directly (ie, it makes the metadata correct\r\nthus removing the alert).\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
