          "message": "doc: split actions pages (#9949)\n\n* doc: move r/actions tor r/actions/index and rename\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* doc: split actions to individual pages\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* fix(doc): use doc links instead of xrefs\r\n\r\nFixes #9947\r\n\r\nThis removes the xref feature of the dune domain. Instead we link to\r\ndocuments.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* doc: group actions by theme\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* doc: diff? -> diffq\r\n\r\nWindows has trouble with that\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
