          "id": "01ba43fd04aa1ac8f9733f2ed0121499b4233630",
          "message": "pkg: add depopts to depends when available (#10282)\n\nWhen a package's optional dependency is among the packages in the\r\ndependency solution for the project, we want that package's build take\r\nplace after its optional dependency has been built. This allows the\r\npackage's build commands to observe that its optional dependency is\r\ninstalled. This can be achieved by adding a package's optional\r\ndependency to its lockfile's `depends` field if the optional dependency\r\nis part of the dependency solution.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
