          "id": "48b0faa35c7ed36b8999d1b34057471e4e87105b",
          "message": "always block signals and attempt to shutdown gracefully (#10438)\n\nWe should always block signals so that we have a chance to shutdown\r\nproperly instead of violently. However, it's not always appropriate to\r\nprint the warning message. I'm not claiming that all the decisions in\r\nthis commit are correct, but they are as close to behavior-preserving as\r\npossible.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Philip White <code@trailingwhite.space>",
