          "message": "Add repro for exec watch mode bug (#10391)\n\nThis adds a test reproducing a bug with exec watch mode where dune is\r\nunable to find an executable if it's specified with a relative path\r\nwhen the user's cwd is not the project root.\r\n\r\nNote that the watch mode tests are disabled by default as they are\r\nflakey.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Corentin Leruth <corentin.leruth@gmail.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Corentin Leruth <corentin.leruth@gmail.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
