          "message": "Set install_roots for toolchain packages (#10787)\n\nThis fixes an issue with toolchain packages where they would export an\r\nenvironment based on their target dir within the _build directory\r\nrather than an environment based on their actual install\r\nlocation (their \"prefix\").\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
