          "id": "5ac095c7c0c13ba5bf2de1becbe512d893c4e72b",
          "message": "feature: improve hints for dune runtest (#11135)\n\nWe improve the hints given by `dune runtest` by letting it also hint\r\nabout directories, which was missing before. This allows directory cram\r\ntests to also be suggested when a user mispells a test name.\r\n\r\nWe also improve the \"not found\" message to one about a test not being\r\nfound in case the user passes a non-test file.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
